.venv/
# A second, stale virtualenv (mypy only) was committed in full - 2064 files, ~59MB of
# git objects, 93% of everything tracked. Untracked in the same change that added this
# line; the pattern covers both spellings so it cannot come back.
venv/
env/

# IDE project settings are local to a developer.
.idea/

# Windows "downloaded from the internet" markers, created per-file next to whatever was
# copied in. A batch of these got committed alongside a mockup imported from a browser
# download.
*:Zone.Identifier

# The v0 prototype, dropped in for reference rather than as part of the package. It
# carries a live Discord bot token (bot/config.yml) and ~424MB of vendored ffmpeg
# binaries, so committing it as-is would leak a credential and bloat the repo. Remove
# this line only after the token is revoked and the binaries are stripped.
ChroniclerProto/
Chronicler.spec
Chronicler
Chronicler.exe
.claude
